  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg">
        <tei:pb ed="1965" n="20" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg"/>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="135" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/1" n="1"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>Halleluyah: Praise the Name of the Lord, give praise, servants of the Lord <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/2" n="2"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>who stand in the House of the Lord, in the courtyards of the House of God. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/3" n="3"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>Halleluyah for the Lord is good, sing to His Name for it is delightful. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/4" n="4"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>For the Lord chose Jacob for Himself, Israel as His own possession. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/5" n="5"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>For I know that the Lord is great, and that our Master is greater than all the deities. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/6" n="6"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>All that the Lord wills He does in heaven and on earth, in the seas and all the depths. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/7" n="7"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>He brings clouds up from the end of the earth, makes lightning with the rain, brings the wind forth from His treasuries. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/8" n="8"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>He slew the firstborn of Egypt from man to beast. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/9" n="9"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>He sent signs and wonders in your midst, O Egypt, against Pharaoh and all his servants. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/10" n="10"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>He smote numerous peoples and slew mighty kings, <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/11" n="11"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>Sihon, King of the Amorites, and Og, king of Bashan, and all the realms of Canaan, <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/12" n="12"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n56.jpg" n="20"/>and gave their land as an <tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>inheritance, an inheritance to His people Israel. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/13" n="13"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>O Lord, Thy Name endures for ever, O Lord, Thy memory from generation to generation. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/14" n="14"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>For the Lord judges His people and has pity on His servants. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/15" n="15"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>The idols of the nations are of silver and gold, the work of human hands. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/16" n="16"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>They have a mouth and do not speak, they have eyes and do not see. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/17" n="17"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>They have ears and do not hear, nor is there any breath in their mouth. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/18" n="18"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>Like them will be those who made them, everyone who trusts in them. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/19" n="19"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>O House of Israel, bless the Lord, O House of Aaron, bless the Lord, <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/20" n="20"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>O House of Levi, praise the Lord, O those that fear the Lord, bless the Lord. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/135/21" n="21"/><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n58.jpg" n="21"/>Blessed be the Lord from Zion, He Who dwells in Jerusalem. Halleluyah. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
</tei:TEI>
